{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","破晓千光"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","飞到半空连续发射剑气，最后一击造成额外伤害并将敌人击飞。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","萨基塔里斯飞向半空，使自身无法被攻击，持续6秒。技能持续期间，自身的普通攻击变为向敌方最密集区域发射剑气，对半径一格范围内的所有敌人造成170% + 15% ATK点伤害。当发射最后一击时，伤害提高至250% ATK并击飞敌人。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":72,"end":78,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":68,"end":82,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":100,"end":108,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","本技能持续期间，萨基塔里斯获得技能“珍酿乐宴”的主动加成效果。如果自身已受该加成效果影响，则在本技能持续期间不消耗该加成效果的剩余时间，直至本技能结束。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","剑气的伤害提升至180% + 15% ATK，最后一击的伤害提升至260% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":33,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","本技能持续期间，若自身参与击败敌方英雄，则可使本技能的剩余持续时间延长2秒。每次释放本技能，最多只能触发1次该效果。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":15,"tooltip_key":"keyword:takedown"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","剑气的伤害提升至190% + 15% ATK，最后一击的伤害提升至270% ATK。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":18,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":8,"end":22,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":33,"end":41,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","裂空星辉"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","自身的普通攻击距离提升，并能穿透敌人。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，萨基塔里斯的普通攻击变为穿透攻击，对沿途所有敌人造成145% + 15% ATK伤害。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":34,"end":40,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":30,"end":44,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","穿透攻击的伤害提升至150% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","若当前所处的位置不佳，萨基塔里斯会在攻击间隙瞬移至一个更好的位置。该效果每6秒至多触发一次。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","穿透攻击的伤害提升至155% + 15% ATK。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":20,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"PlusRatio"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":24,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","珍酿乐宴"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","自身在获得友军增益效果时获得额外增益。主动使用时为自身提升攻击力和攻击速度。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","被动地，当自身获得一名友军施加的非永久属性提升效果时，将会积攒一层“沉醉”，使自身永久提高15%攻击力与15点攻击速度，该效果最多叠加3层，且通过每名友军最多只能触发一次。主动使用时，饮下神界佳酿，使自身提高20% + 2%攻击力与20 + 3点攻击速度，持续12秒。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":107,"end":112,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":118,"end":122,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每层“沉醉”提供的攻击力加成提升至16%，攻击速度加成提升至16。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每层“沉醉”提供的攻击力加成提升至18%，攻击速度加成提升至18。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","主动使用时的加成效果提升至25% + 2%点攻击力与25 + 3点攻击速度。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":16,"end":21,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg3"},{"start":28,"end":32,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg4"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","每次普通攻击后永久提升自身攻击速度。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","每次普通攻击永久提升自身3点攻击速度，至多提升30点。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","每次普通攻击永久提升自身4点攻击速度，至多提升40点。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每次普通攻击永久提升自身5点攻击速度，至多提升50点。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","流光天击"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","自身获得满层“沉醉”效果时方可使用，对所有敌人造成真实伤害。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","本技能仅在自身拥有的“沉醉”层数已叠加至满层时方可使用。短暂延迟后，召唤光枪从天而降，对场上所有敌人造成200% ATK真实伤害。本技能每场战斗最多释放3次。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":52,"end":60,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","本技能造成的伤害提升至210% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","每场战斗首次释放本技能时，还会附带目标当前生命值20%的额外真实伤害，并会使目标在后续8秒内降低60点受愈。本技能附带的额外伤害最高不超过自身攻击力的1000%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","本技能造成的伤害提升至220% ATK。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":11,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","主动使用技能“珍酿乐宴”时，还会提高自身的终结。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","主动使用技能“珍酿乐宴”时，还会使自身在持续期间内提高20点终结。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","主动使用技能“珍酿乐宴“时，饮下佳酿的速度加快50%，且佳酿持续时间内获得可以抵御60% HP的护盾。此外，在叠加满层“沉醉”后，额外提升自身25点终结。"],["/skills/5/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":41,"end":47,"tooltip_key":"stat:HP"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","耀空"]]}